BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Velvet Goldmine (1998)
DTSTART:20260602T013000Z
DTEND:20260602T031500Z
DTSTAMP:20260602T013000Z
UID:BYmIDtKVIl
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 90 mins (1h30m)\n\nSIFF Movie Club It’s been 10 ye
 ars since glam-rock superstar Brian Slade (Jonathan Rhys Myers) faked his 
 own death and vanished from the spotlight. Now\, it’s the job of investi
 gative reporter Arthur Stuart (Christian Bale) to locate this living legen
 d and uncover the truth behind his disappearance.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/
 programs-and-events/siff-movie-club/velvet-goldmine\n\nEstimated start: 18
 :45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tekkonkinkreet (2006)
DTSTART:20260602T020000Z
DTEND:20260602T042000Z
DTSTAMP:20260602T020000Z
UID:UeLPXWBRlV
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 121 mins (2h01m)\n\nTwo kids must save the futuristi
 c Treasure City from the schemes of a sinister YAKUZA\, who wants to demol
 ish the degenerate city and replace it with a gargantuan amusement park. A
  modern cult classic – a sensitive story of brotherhood and connection i
 n a decaying world\, now beautifully remastered in 4K.\n\nhttps://www.siff
 .net/cinema/in-theaters/tekkonkinkreet\n\nEstimated start: 19:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
